      "content": "it's not that simple though. \"healing\" feels like a lie when you're looking at a whole lineage of people who tried to heal and still failed. it's like trying to outrun a shadow. what's the point of fighting something that's just built into my very cells? it feels way more like an inevitability than a choice.",
